      }
    ],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Every year, the world "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about 400 million tonnes "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "tonnes",
            "zh": "吨"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of plastic waste. That’s a huge "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! Sadly, only about ten percent of this waste gets "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "recycled",
            "ref": "v-recycle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But here comes some good "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—a lovely dog is "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "doing his part to",
            "ref": "v-do-ones-part-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " help with this big problem."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The dog’s name is Scruff. He is a 13-year-old border collie "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "border collie",
            "zh": "边境牧羊犬"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Back in 2021, he started to show a special "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in plastic bottles. Whenever he went out for a walk with his owners, his eyes were always "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bottles. He would pick up one bottle with his mouth and carry it "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " he found another one on the street."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At first, Scruff’s owners thought this habit was a bit "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Then, they had a better idea. They decided to train him. They taught Scruff to drop every bottle he found right at their feet. They would then collect all these bottles in a big bag and take them back home for recycling. Over the past year, this "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hard-working",
            "ref": "v-hard-working"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " dog has "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more than 1,000 plastic items! His owners are very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of him and shared his story online. Soon, Scruff became famous and got a cool nickname—“the eco dog”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Think about it: If a dog can "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the importance of protecting the environment, what about us? What can you do to help?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
